  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Stock",
      "items": [
        "inventory_levels is keyed by (variant_id, location_id); a CHECK keeps 0 <= reserved <= on_hand.",
        "inventory_reservations hold stock for an order or an exchange until committed, released or expired."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Append-only",
      "items": [
        "inventory_movements is append-only: UPDATE and DELETE are revoked from the app role.",
        "Its reference_id is a soft reference with no FK."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Collections",
      "items": [
        "collection_products.source says whether a product was added by hand or by a rule.",
        "product_sales_stats is derived: 7 and 30 day units plus best-selling and trending ranks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Reading this diagram",
      "items": [
        "A column typed 'uuid → table.column' is a foreign key into a table drawn in another diagram of this set.",
